+	/*
+	 * Anything posted to this processor while it was out, before the ticks.
+	 * This is the boundary a woken processor comes back through, so it is
+	 * where a reschedule or a cross-processor call has to be noticed --
+	 * smp_call_function's caller is spinning on a completion until it is.
+	 *
+	 * Inside irq_enter()/irq_exit(), and both halves are load-bearing.
+	 *
+	 * RCU is NOT watching here: default_idle_call() wraps arch_cpu_idle()
