+	 * walk RCU-protected cgroup and sched-domain data and fire
+	 * tracepoints. Running them while RCU is told this CPU is quiescent is
+	 * how a grace period completes underneath a live dereference.
+	 * ct_irq_enter(), inside irq_enter(), is what suspends the EQS, and it
+	 * is the same pairing co_colinux_drain_time() already uses one line
+	 * below.
+	 *
