+ * underneath -- the START_VCPU handshake, the passage page the host made for
+ * vCPU 1, the shared address space, and the entry contract through the boot
+ * shim -- actually works. Testing both at once is what made every failure
+ * indistinguishable: the box reset and there was no way to tell which half
